cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "UCBFaculty: Faculty Data Tools for Berkeley's Academic Senate"
abstract: >-
  Python tools for assembling and reconciling data about faculty and
  other academic personnel across disparate University of California
  sources.  Developed for use by the Berkeley Division of the Academic
  Senate, and used both for committee-appointment work and for
  bibliometric analysis.
